# Raw per-game shim JSONL: 94 MB across three arms, and nothing reads it after
# the per-cell tally is computed. `results.jsonl` carries every number in
# RESULTS.md (games, decided, plan_wins, per-seat wins, arm verification), and
# the cells regenerate by re-running run_pilot.py. Same rule as
# engine/sim_results/ (CLAUDE.md).
runs_*/cell_*.jsonl
